    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653310/extras/8decc7cf315f96323634525cde0fc538.avif?t=1740161449\" /></div><br>Come in! Nightclub with neon Rhythm Story sign. Music and fun give way to screams. The corpse of the girl was found in the toilet. Panic. The detective is ready. What evidence is there? What is the motive? An atmospheric rhythm adventure with a deep storyline.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653310/extras/19da4b7cb59fead89ca1ccb262be6c3d.avif?t=1740161449\" /></div><br><br>Mei and Rei have been best friends since childhood, but recently Rei began to go somewhere every evening, and return in the morning. She used to have problems with the law, but May hoped that was in the past. They started going to the Rhythm Story nightclub and everything was fine ...<br><br>Until one of the girls was found dead there<br><br>The detective will get down to business to understand what is really going on in their city<br><br>This project is a cross between Rhythm Doctor and Night in the Woods in the manner of storytelling. You have to not only solve the case, but also protect the criminal<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653310/extras/19e8ed06929253ca7856176e41d20606.avif?t=1740161449\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features</h2><br><strong>\u2981 Easy to play and atmospheric<br>\u2981 You will relax and have a good time<br>\u2981 Deep detailed detective storyline<br>\u2981 Humor<br>\u2981 The plot is divided into days: rhythm games every game day<br>\u2981 Nice graphics</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features</h2> <br><strong>\u2981 The game is divided into game days<br>\u2981 Fast-paced storyline<br>\u2981 Trust the music and hit the buttons to the beat<br>\u2981 Choose the answer options and influence the plot</strong><br><br>The game is created with love by a small experienced team of 3 people...",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653310/extras/8decc7cf315f96323634525cde0fc538.avif?t=1740161449\" /></div><br>Come in! Nightclub with neon Rhythm Story sign. Music and fun give way to screams. The corpse of the girl was found in the toilet. Panic. The detective is ready. What evidence is there? What is the motive? An atmospheric rhythm adventure with a deep storyline.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653310/extras/19da4b7cb59fead89ca1ccb262be6c3d.avif?t=1740161449\" /></div><br><br>Mei and Rei have been best friends since childhood, but recently Rei began to go somewhere every evening, and return in the morning. She used to have problems with the law, but May hoped that was in the past. They started going to the Rhythm Story nightclub and everything was fine ...<br><br>Until one of the girls was found dead there<br><br>The detective will get down to business to understand what is really going on in their city<br><br>This project is a cross between Rhythm Doctor and Night in the Woods in the manner of storytelling. You have to not only solve the case, but also protect the criminal<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653310/extras/19e8ed06929253ca7856176e41d20606.avif?t=1740161449\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features</h2><br><strong>\u2981 Easy to play and atmospheric<br>\u2981 You will relax and have a good time<br>\u2981 Deep detailed detective storyline<br>\u2981 Humor<br>\u2981 The plot is divided into days: rhythm games every game day<br>\u2981 Nice graphics</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features</h2> <br><strong>\u2981 The game is divided into game days<br>\u2981 Fast-paced storyline<br>\u2981 Trust the music and hit the buttons to the beat<br>\u2981 Choose the answer options and influence the plot</strong><br><br>The game is created with love by a small experienced team of 3 people...",
